abstract: >-
  A complete seventeen-family cover for constant-one ten-coordinate singleton
  components with three exceptional inputs, with written reductions and a
  standard-library exact verifier, supplements the retained two-exceptional
  classification and ten conditional exclusions. The fourteen-variable
  existence question remains open. Substantial AI assistance is disclosed;
  human review, formal verification and mathematical novelty are not established.
